1. Overview & Objectives
System testing validates the complete, integrated software product to ensure it meets specified requirements across functional, performance, security, and usability dimensions.
* Test Scope: End-to-end user journeys, component integration, API/backend communication (if applicable), UI design token consistency, and cross-platform/cross-browser responsiveness.
